{"id":4508,"title":{"romaji":"Delico's Nursery","english":"Delico's Nursery","native":"デリコズ・ナーサリー"},"slug":"delicos_nursery","synopsis":"Hailing from the prestigious noble house of Delico, Dali Delico is an elite member of the Blood Pact Council with a promising future. When the Blood Pact Council, the highest governing body for the Vamps, assigns a special mission to Dali, he flatly refuses it. Having lost patience, Gerhard, Dino, and Henrique, who are also Council members serving the same term as Dali, rush to the house of Delico to persuade him.\n\nWhat they witness there is Dali, taking care of an infant himself… Meanwhile, there has been a series of mysterious murders targeting Vamps. Can they find the right balance between their absolute mission and childcare in this magnificent gothic world?!","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2024,"createdAt":"2025-01-16 02:19:39","updatedAt":"2025-01-16 02:19:39","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":12288},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18148},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":167991},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":23779},{"site":"ANN","externalId":29294},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":47835},{"site":"MAL","externalId":56179},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12468,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/gT1JqvwE0r97MqJ2huGLEGipcR9fmq0ZQoPz1AyB.avif"},{"id":12469,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/EygX5zWrqp1bYX1yUZoRYBS4kno7wsuoPo1w3q56.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":34,"name":"J.C.Staff","slug":"jcstaff"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":13471,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":13405,"title":{"romaji":"UNFAIR","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":15747,"version":1,"episodes":"1-","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":18540,"basename":"DelicosNursery-OP1.webm","filename":"DelicosNursery-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes